Father Alvin was added in '''Beta 30.0'''. Its Magic effect made it move 2 random monsters from your dustpile back to your hand. '''Beta 40.0''' nerfed it by not allowing other Alvins already dead to be brought back.

'''Beta 42.1''', alongside increasing its HP from 6 to 7, changed its Magic again. Now, it functions as a "Choose one" effect, showing 3 monsters from your dustpile and you can choose 1 of them to be added to your hand. It won't show multiple copies of the same monster, and while you can get other Alvins back, DT-monsters are now unobtainable from this.

=== Stats ===
ATK: 4

HP:
* 6 (Post Beta 30.0)
* 7 (Post Beta 42.1, Current)

Cost: 7

Abilities:
* Magic: Move randomly from your dustpile to your hand...
** 2 monsters. (Post Beta 30.0)
** 2 other monsters. (Post Beta 40.0)
** 1 non-DT monster from a choice of 3 different ones.
*** (Post Beta 42.1, Current)
Rarity: Purple (Epic)
